以下是目前的完整程式：
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>小徑心理諮商所｜台北市中山區個別與伴侶諮商｜預約初談</title>
<meta name="description" content="小徑心理諮商所，台北市中山區。預約前不需要留任何資料；隱私、取消規則與危機資源都寫在預約之前。">
<!-- 小徑心理諮商所：資料計量表。暖米白底、深青綠、圓角卡片、黑體；桌機右側固定一張「您目前填了幾項」，手機改放在表單裡。單一檔案，CSS 與 JavaScript 都在這裡。 -->
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f8f5ee; --card:#ffffff; --soft:#dcedee; --line:#bcd6d8;
  --ink:#10292e; --ink2:#3a555c; --teal:#0e6b73; --teald:#09525a; --sun:#f6d067;
  --sans:"PingFang TC","Noto Sans TC","Hiragino Sans TC","Microsoft JhengHei",sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:18px/1.85 var(--sans)}
h1,h2,h3{font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;margin:0}
p{margin:0}
a{color:var(--teald)}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
.vh{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal);outline-offset:3px}

/* 頁首 */
.top{background:var(--card);border-bottom:2px solid var(--line)}
.top-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px 28px}
.brand{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.brand i{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--teal);display:inline-block}
.brand span{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink2)}
.top nav{display:none;gap:18px;font-size:16px}
.top nav a{color:var(--ink2);text-decoration:none;min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}
.top nav a:hover{color:var(--teald);text-decoration:underline}
.help{font-size:16px;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--sun);color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;white-space:nowrap}
.help:hover{background:#efc44d}

.wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 320px;gap:48px;align-items:start}
.main{min-width:0}

/* 首屏：先給一個 0 */
.hero{padding:52px 0 60px}
.eyebrow{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--teal);letter-spacing:.06em}
.hero-grid{display:flex;gap:36px;align-items:center;margin:16px 0 18px}
.zero{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;color:var(--teal);flex:none;position:relative;padding-top:32px}
.filled-label{position:absolute;top:0;left:4px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800}
.zn{font-size:176px;line-height:.9;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.zu{font-size:44px;font-weight:800}
h1{font-size:44px;letter-spacing:.02em}
.sub{font-size:19px;color:var(--ink2);max-width:36em;margin-top:8px}
.cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:28px;align-items:center}
.btn{font:inherit;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:52px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:14px;border:2px solid var(--teal);text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}
.btn-primary{background:var(--teal);color:#fff}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--teald)}
.btn-quiet{background:var(--card);color:var(--teald)}
.btn-quiet:hover{background:var(--soft)}
.btn-text{border-color:transparent;color:var(--teald);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;padding:0 8px}
.soft{margin-top:20px;font-size:18px;color:var(--ink2)}
.photo{position:relative;margin-top:34px;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:16/7;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d3e6e3,#f1ede2)}
.photo svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
.photo .hero-photo{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}

/* 每一節：一張白卡 */
.sec{padding:48px 0;border-top:2px solid var(--line)}
h2{font-size:32px;margin-bottom:8px}
.lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--ink2);margin-bottom:26px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:26px 28px}
.blk{margin:0 0 22px;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:24px 28px}
.blk:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
h3{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px}
.blk p,.blk li{font-size:18px}
.blk ul{margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:1.3em}

/* 信任 */
.quote{background:var(--teald);color:#fff;border-radius:22px;padding:34px 38px}
.quote p{font-size:24px;line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 .7em;font-weight:600}
.quote .sign{font-size:18px;font-weight:500;margin:6px 0 0}
.profile{margin:22px 0 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);gap:0;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}
.profile dt,.profile dd{margin:0;padding:15px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.profile dt{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--teald);background:#eaf4f4}
.profile dt:nth-last-of-type(1),.profile dd:last-of-type{border-bottom:0}
.profile dd{font-size:18px}
.aside-card{margin-top:22px;background:#fff8e2;border:2px solid var(--sun);border-radius:18px;padding:24px 28px}
.aside-card h3{font-size:22px}
.aside-card p{font-size:18px}

/* 流程 */
.steps{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:12px;counter-reset:s}
.steps li{grid-column:span 2}
.steps li:nth-child(n+4){grid-column:span 3}
@media (max-width:1180px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.steps li,.steps li:nth-child(n+4){grid-column:auto}.steps li:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}}
@media (max-width:640px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.steps li{counter-increment:s;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px}
.steps li::before{content:counter(s);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--teald);font-size:16px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px}
.steps li.is-done{background:#eaf4f4}
.steps li[aria-current=step]{border-color:var(--teal);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--sun)}
.steps li[aria-current=step]::before{background:var(--teal);color:#fff}
.steps b{display:block;font-size:19px}
.steps span{display:block;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.7;margin-top:2px}
.fit{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:22px}
.fit>div{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:20px 22px}
.fit>div:last-child{border-color:var(--teal)}
.fit h3{font-size:20px}
.fit p{font-size:18px}

/* 服務 */
.svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
.svc-card{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:20px 22px}
.svc-card h3{margin-bottom:2px}
.svc-card .m{font-size:16px;color:var(--teald);font-weight:700;display:block;margin-bottom:6px}
.svc-card p{font-size:18px}
.fee{margin-top:14px;padding:22px 26px;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--teal);border-radius:16px;font-size:18px}

/* 隱私與規則 */
.tier-list{list-style:none;margin:8px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:10px}
.tier-list li{background:#eaf4f4;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:18px}
.tier-list b{display:block;font-size:19px}
.bound{margin:6px 0 0}
.bound dt{font-weight:700;font-size:19px;margin-top:12px}
.bound dd{margin:0;font-size:18px}
.crisis{border-color:var(--teal);background:#f1fafa}
.blk .crisis-list{list-style:none;margin:14px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:10px}
.crisis-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 16px 12px}
.tel{font-size:38px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teald);line-height:1.2;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:52px}
.tel-none{font-size:30px}
.tel-l{font-size:18px;color:var(--ink2)}

/* 預約 */
.crisis-note{font-size:18px;background:#fff8e2;border:2px solid var(--sun);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:20px}
.crisis-note strong{display:block;width:fit-content;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:8px}
.crisis-note p{margin:0}
.crisis-note a,.foot-crisis a{font-weight:800}
.state-line{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--teald);margin-bottom:14px}
.form-note{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:18px}
.form-note .nb{white-space:nowrap}
.mini-meter{display:none;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--teal);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}
.mini-meter output{font-size:24px;color:var(--teal)}
.form-card{background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:30px 32px}
fieldset{border:0;margin:0;padding:0;min-width:0}
legend{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;padding:0;margin-bottom:4px}
.pick{margin-bottom:26px}
.hint{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink2);margin-bottom:12px}
.svc-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
.svc{display:block;position:relative;cursor:pointer}
.svc input{position:absolute;opacity:0;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;cursor:pointer}
.svc-b{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;height:100%;padding:14px 16px;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--card);min-height:64px}
.svc-name{font-size:20px;font-weight:800}
.svc-meta{font-size:16px;color:var(--teald);font-weight:700}
.svc-desc{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.65}
.svc:hover .svc-b{background:#f1fafa}
.svc input:checked+.svc-b{border-color:var(--teal);background:var(--soft);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--sun)}
.svc input:focus-visible+.svc-b{outline:3px solid var(--teal);outline-offset:2px}
.slot-day{display:grid;grid-template-columns:118px minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px 14px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;border-top:2px dashed var(--line)}
.slot-date{font-size:18px;font-weight:800}
.slot-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.slot{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:48px;padding:0 16px;border:2px solid var(--teal);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);cursor:pointer;font-size:18px;font-weight:700}
.slot input{position:absolute;opacity:0;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;cursor:pointer}
.slot .slot-m{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink2)}
.slot:has(input:checked){background:var(--teal);color:#fff}
.slot:has(input:checked) .slot-m{color:#fff}
.slot:has(input:focus-visible){outline:3px solid var(--teal);outline-offset:2px}
.slot.is-taken{background:#e6eded;border-color:#9db4b8;border-style:dashed;color:#4a6167;cursor:not-allowed;font-weight:500}
.slot.is-taken .slot-m,.slot.is-taken .slot-n{color:#4a6167}
.slot-n{font-size:16px}
.slot-any{margin-top:12px}
.summary{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;margin:4px 0 22px;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:12px}
.privacy-box{background:#f1fafa;border:2px solid var(--teal);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:24px}
.privacy-box h3{font-size:20px}
.privacy-box ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:1.3em}
.privacy-box li{font-size:18px}
.field{margin-bottom:22px}
.field label{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:4px}
input[type=text],textarea{width:100%;font:inherit;font-size:18px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--ink2);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;min-height:52px}
textarea{resize:vertical;line-height:1.7}
input[type=text]:focus,textarea:focus{outline:3px solid var(--teal);outline-offset:2px;border-color:var(--teal)}
.field small{display:block;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:6px}
.consent{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:18px;margin:4px 0 22px;cursor:pointer;padding:8px 0;font-weight:600}
.consent input{width:26px;height:26px;margin:4px 0 0;flex:none;accent-color:var(--teal)}
#submit{width:100%;max-width:360px}
.confirm{background:var(--card);border:3px solid var(--teal);border-radius:22px;padding:30px 32px;outline:0}
.confirm h3{font-size:26px}
.state-pill{display:inline-block;margin:8px 0 16px;padding:4px 16px;background:var(--sun);border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800}
.recap{margin:0 0 18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px minmax(0,1fr);border-top:2px solid var(--line)}
.recap dt,.recap dd{margin:0;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:18px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.recap dt{font-size:16px;color:var(--teald);font-weight:800}
.confirm p{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:12px}
.confirm .btn{margin-top:8px}

.contact{margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px minmax(0,1fr);background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}
.contact dt,.contact dd{margin:0;padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:18px}
.contact dt{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teald);background:#eaf4f4}
.contact dt:nth-last-of-type(1),.contact dd:last-of-type{border-bottom:0}

.model{margin-top:26px;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:6px 22px}
.model summary{font-size:18px;min-height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
.model-body>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px minmax(0,1fr);gap:4px 18px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:16px}
.model-body b{font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:16px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.model-body em{display:block;font-style:normal;color:var(--teald);margin-top:4px;font-weight:700}

/* 右側計量表 */
.meter{position:relative;top:0;margin-top:52px;background:var(--card);border:3px solid var(--teal);border-radius:22px;padding:22px 24px}
.meter-h{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:var(--teald);letter-spacing:.06em}
.meter-n{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin:2px 0 10px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700}
.meter-n output{font-size:76px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;color:var(--teal)}
.meter-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:2px solid var(--line)}
.meter-list li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:18px}
.meter-list em{font-style:normal;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink2)}
.meter-list li::before{content:"";width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid var(--ink2);flex:none;margin-right:2px}
.meter-list li.is-filled::before{background:var(--teal);border-color:var(--teal)}
.meter-list li.is-filled em{color:var(--teald);font-weight:800}
.meter-list li span{flex:1}
.meter-note{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink2);margin:12px 0 14px}
.meter-steps{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;font-size:16px;counter-reset:m}
.meter-steps li{counter-increment:m;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:4px 0;color:var(--ink2)}
.meter-steps li::before{content:counter(m);width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--teald);font-weight:800;font-size:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none}
.meter-steps li[aria-current=step]{color:var(--ink);font-weight:800}
.meter-steps li[aria-current=step]::before{background:var(--teal);color:#fff}
.meter-steps li.is-done::before{background:#bfe0e2}

footer{background:var(--ink);color:#eaf4f4;padding:42px 28px 50px;margin-top:20px}
footer .in{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto}
footer .fname{font-size:24px;font-weight:800}
footer p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;margin-top:8px}
footer a{color:#fff}
footer .foot-crisis{font-size:18px}
footer .foot-crisis a{display:inline-block;min-height:44px;line-height:44px;padding:0 4px}

@media (max-width:1080px){
  .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}
  .meter{display:none}
  /* 手機:計數條在頁面最頂端(頁首上面),細一條,捲動時黏在視窗上緣 */
  .mini-meter{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30;margin:0;border-width:0 0 2px;border-radius:0;padding:8px 16px}
  html{scroll-padding-top:56px}
}
@media (min-width:1081px){.top nav{display:flex}}
@media (max-width:760px){
  .top-in{padding:10px 16px}
  .brand span{display:none}
  .wrap{padding:0 16px}
  .hero{padding:34px 0 44px}
  .hero-grid{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px}
  .zn{font-size:112px}
  .zu{font-size:36px}
  h1{font-size:34px}
  .sub{font-size:18px}
  .cta{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
  .btn{width:100%}
  .btn-text{width:auto;align-self:flex-start}
  .photo{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:16px}
  .sec{padding:38px 0}
  h2{font-size:32px}
  .blk,.card,.aside-card{padding:20px 18px}
  .quote{padding:26px 20px}
  .quote p{font-size:22px}
  .profile,.contact,.recap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .profile dt,.contact dt{padding:10px 18px}
  .profile dd,.contact dd{padding:10px 18px 14px}
  .fit,.svc-grid,.svc-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .crisis-list{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .form-card{padding:20px 14px}
  .slot-day{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .confirm{padding:22px 16px}
  .model-body>div{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  #submit{max-width:none}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p class="mini-meter">您目前填了 <output data-count>0</output> 項（只在您的畫面上）</p>
<header class="top">
<div class="top-in">
<a class="brand" href="#top"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>小徑<span>心理諮商所</span></a>
<nav aria-label="頁面導覽">
<a href="#trust">諮商師</a><a href="#flow">預約流程</a><a href="#services">服務與費用</a><a href="#privacy">隱私與規則</a><a href="#booking">預約</a><a href="#contact">聯絡</a>
</nav>
<a class="help" href="#crisis">我需要立即協助</a>
</div>
</header>
<div class="wrap">
<main class="main" id="top">

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="h1">
<p class="eyebrow">台北市中山區　預約制　現場與線上</p>
<div class="hero-grid">
<div class="zero" aria-label="已填項數"><span class="filled-label">已填</span><output class="zn" data-count>0</output><span class="zu">項</span></div>
<h1 id="h1">瀏覽這一頁，<br>不需要交出任何資料。</h1>
</div>
<p class="sub">小徑心理諮商所提供成年人的個別諮商、伴侶諮商與線上諮商。適合想找人說說，但還沒決定要不要開始的您。預約只收稱呼、聯絡方式、偏好時段、服務類型，和一格可以不寫的簡短需求。</p>
<p class="cta"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#booking">預約初談</a><a class="btn btn-quiet" href="#flow">了解服務方式</a><a class="btn btn-text" href="#crisis">我需要立即協助</a></p>
<p class="soft">您可以先只看看。預約前，不需要留下任何資料。</p>
<div class="photo" aria-hidden="true">
<svg viewBox="0 0 1120 490" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" focusable="false">
